WEBVTT

00:08:29.139 --> 00:08:30.507
So ...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.042
You know, this was my chance,

00:08:32.042 --> 00:08:33.543
and I latched onto this kid --

00:08:33.576 --> 00:08:35.912
like, I'm serious,
I grabbed her and I held her.

00:08:37.013 --> 00:08:39.282
And I came out to her on that bus,

00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:41.918
for the first time in two years.

00:08:43.186 --> 00:08:45.221
And she actually told me ...

00:08:45.221 --> 00:08:46.389
that it was cool.

00:08:48.358 --> 00:08:50.126
She asked me a couple of questions,

00:08:50.126 --> 00:08:53.263
and what she really did was give me
a place to talk about myself

00:08:53.296 --> 00:08:55.765
that I hadn't had in years.

00:08:56.299 --> 00:08:58.668
And she gave me the confidence
to keep coming out

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.970
to other kids at Waynflete
as the weeks went on.